    kuna infrastructure test: restart observability (roadmap item 5).

    Mechanism (c) - global restart with persisted hints - is the most
    diagnostic feedback signal in the engine and was previously invisible.
    This test reuses the upstream switchmulti binary
    (tests/datatests/switchmulti.xml): its jump table is not fully
    recovered during flow analysis, so JumpTable::recoverLabels installs an
    Override::insertMultistageJump hint and restarts the function (edge 2 of
